type: software
title: "Replication package: Severe Safeguards and Fiscal Capacity"
abstract: >-
  Data and code reproducing every table and figure in "Severe Safeguards and
  Fiscal Capacity: The Political Economy of Intergovernmental Retaliation",
  from raw INEGI, CONAPO and Banco de México sources through to the reported
  estimates.
